# Org context hub

- Start from `AGENTS.md` + `CONTEXT-MAP.md`; load one domain at a time
- Orchestrate via `.cursor/TEAM.md` — prefer subagents over growing root context
- Checkouts only under `checkouts/` (`org/links.yaml`); never commit clones
- No secrets; no commit/push/PR unless the user asks
- Intake → `requirement-triage`; plan/progress → `product-lead`; code → `engineer-in-<role>` (dev|test|design|review|devops)
